OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy on Tuesday and
OL,7,FWednesday with rain at times. Bright
OL,8,Fspells between bands of showery rain
OL,9,Fon Thursday.
